ClashNl for Android
===================

This directory is a modified distribution of SagerNet/sing-box-for-android at
commit 106e8527416a665ebb04d32f6fdd454ae7de49d1 and links a modified sing-box
Libbox AAR at commit 03c3bf4c01e7b1fd165d0c46ff376828fa878aab
(v1.14.0-beta.2).

Upstream sources:
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
  https://github.com/SagerNet/termux-app

The Android client and sing-box core are distributed under GNU General Public
License version 3 or later. The copied client license is in LICENSE. The
Termux terminal component license is in third_party/termux-app/LICENSE.md.

ClashNl changes include independent branding and package ID, Clash/Mihomo YAML
conversion, Clash/Clash Meta import links, Android privacy disclosure, and
shared protocol examples. The client-side XHTTP framing and VLESS post-quantum
encryption compatibility code under Core/overlay/transport is adapted from
MetaCubeX/mihomo under GPL-3.0-or-later:
  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo

The Android package includes the 2026-08-22 country-lite.mmdb snapshot from
MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat under GPL-3.0. It allows Mihomo profiles using GeoIP
DNS filtering to start without an initial network download. Source and license:
  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat
SHA-256:
  248b91c2c9cf46c9ae75b27ab8bee7b44d3f745b6a1372da75b2120494284f7b

